"900.3.10(527)":{"explanation":"Exception RD 527 keeps the lot frontage and lot area the lot had when the by-law was enacted, sets a 7.5 m setback from lot lines abutting Sheppard Ave., Neilson Rd., Tapscott Rd. and Washburn Way, a 1.2 m side setback, a 4.5 m setback from a side lot line abutting a street, and a 0.3 m side setback for garages. No prevailing by-laws apply.","code_refs":"none"},
"900.3.10(553)":{"explanation":"Exception RD 553 keeps the lot frontage and lot area the lot had when the by-law was enacted, caps lot coverage at 50 percent, sets a 1.0 m side setback on one side, a 3.0 m setback from lot lines abutting a street, a 5.0 m setback for a street-facing garage entrance, and requires the parking space to be inside the residential building. No prevailing by-laws apply.","code_refs":"none"},
"900.3.10(159)":{"explanation":"Exception RD 159 keeps the lot frontage and lot area the lot had when the by-law was enacted, sets a 1.2 m side setback and a 3.6 m setback from a side lot line abutting a street, and requires the lands to also comply with exception 900.3.10(1462). No prevailing by-laws apply.","code_refs":"none"}
}}
